				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-433247/scp-foundation-the-movie-2:electric-boogaloo#post-1537924</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Wed, 15 Aug 2012 11:28:22 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>MrBreaksIt</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1379550</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>OH MY GOD! THIS IS THE GREATEST CROSSOVER I'VE EVER SEEN IN MY LIFE!<br /> Phelous being shot multiple times simply made my day. THE STUPID VOICE DOESN'T MAKE IT FUNNY, MATE! I really have nothing negative to say about it other than I'm slightly dissapointed that Spoony, Linkara and Angry Joe weren't in it (although knowing Linkara, he's probably a member of the foundation himself. That's where he purchased the Magic Gun), though Spoony did quit and Joe and Linkara don't review movies, so I can accept that.</p> <p>This is Mr BreaksIt saying there's no such thing as a stupid comment until <em>you</em> post it.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-433247#post-1519335</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
