				<wikidot:authorName>Ihp</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1267048</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Oh god.</p> <p>This made me laugh SO HARD.</p> <p>On a related note, I wonder if anyone from TGWTG actually knows about this site.</p> <p>If so, and an SCP Foundation movie is made IRL, and it sucks, they will have to mention the Foundation website in their review.</p> <p>If that happens, they might come across this article of them reviewing a bad SCP Foundation movie while writing an article that reviews a bad SCP Foundation movie.</p> <p>META!!!</p> <p>Anyway. Upvoted.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
